   "url": "https://soyuz.by/obshchestvo/saharnyy-diabet-u-detey-kak-vo-2-y-detskoy-bolnice-minska-pomogayut-zhit-s-takim-diagnozom-rasskazali-vrachi",
   "src": "soyuz.by",
